---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="Important information about the limitations of Toolsiva tools and generated results."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:py-16">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-brand-300">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">Disclaimer</h1>

    <div class="prose-premium mt-8 space-y-8 text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-300">
      <section>
        <h2>General information</h2>
        <p>
          Toolsiva provides general-purpose utilities and informational results. The service is
          not a substitute for professional advice, certified software, regulatory guidance or
          independent verification.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Calculations and conversions</h2>
        <p>
          Values may be rounded and may depend on assumptions, unit definitions or the data you
          enter. Verify important calculations using an authoritative source.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Security tools</h2>
        <p>
          Password, token, hash and encoding tools do not guarantee that a wider system is secure.
          Security depends on implementation, storage, transmission, configuration and current
          standards.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>QR codes and generated content</h2>
        <p>
          Review QR content before sharing it. Compatibility can vary between scanning devices,
          applications and payload formats.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
